            "enHtml": "<h4>2) Storage phosphor system</h4>\n                  <p><mark class=\"hl-def\" data-pair=\"1\">2) <strong>Storage phosphor system:</strong> use a photo-stimulable phosphor plate that stores the latent image in the phosphor for subsequent readout by an extra-oral laser scanner.</mark></p>\n                  <p><strong>Advantages:</strong></p>\n                  <ol>\n                    <li><mark class=\"hl-num\" data-pair=\"2\">1) Low radiation dose (90% reduction).</mark></li>\n                    <li><mark class=\"hl-num\" data-pair=\"3\">2) Almost instant image (20–30 s).</mark></li>\n                  </ol>",
